	(text_box "32-bit output chain: bit0 drives the sixteenth buffered motion/AUX output; bits1-15 drive the fifteen motion outputs through the same buffers; bits16-31 drive isolated general outputs through TLP291-4 optocouplers and TBD62083AFG field drivers. J12 exposes DO0-DO7 and J32 exposes DO8-DO15."
